tps://api.github.com/users/Zehir/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zehir/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-08T18:40:30Z","updated_at":"2026-02-08T18:40:30Z","body":"I took some time to look what was going on and it's turnout that the problem is finding the file :\n```C\nEditorFileSystemDirectory *dir = EditorFileSystem::get_singleton()->find_file(p_file_path, &index);\n```\nI look at the filesystem dock and I think the easier way to handle that is to set the `FileInfo` object instead of the file path in the metadata and fetch it during the `_tree_thumbnail_done` method.\n\nWe already fetch thoses info on load I think it's worth to cache them that fetching it again\n\nOr make this method faster but I guess it's not that easy :\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/56f3e2611daadb0b1894b46737ee3000e82e33f9/editor/file_system/editor_file_system.cpp#L1863-L1865","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3867890201/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3867895566","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116027#issuecomment-3867895566","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116027","id":3867895566,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mi2cO","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-08T18:41:24Z","updated_at":"2026-02-08T18:45:10Z","body":"So I profiled what takes so long and the engine spends most time in String's `_find_lower()` called from `to_lower()` used in EditorFileSystem's `_find_file()`. Seems to be used to make file searching case-insensitive. I suppose it's so slow, because you have lots of files with very long names. Removing `to_lower()` calls makes things considerably faster, but searching the files still takes the most time.\nEDIT:\nWell, the above problem only applies to case-insensitive file systems.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3867895566/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3867937955","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116027#issuecomment-3867937955","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116027","id":3867937955,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mjAyj","user":{"login":"Zehir","id":845225,"